## Key Concepts Learned Today

| Concept | Simple English Explanation |
|---|---|
| Namespace | A folder inside Kubernetes — keeps teams/environments separated |
| NetworkPolicy | Firewall rules for pods — controls who can talk to who |
| CNI | The network brain — gives every pod an IP address |
| ImagePullBackOff | Kubernetes can't download the container image |
| ContainerCreating | Pod is scheduled but container hasn't started yet |
| k3s | Lightweight Kubernetes — perfect for EC2 labs |
| Default deny | Block all traffic first, then allow only what's needed |

